      "id": "2125782902730326041",
      "text": "#NHLJets beat #Bruins 4-2, Daws 21 saves. Connor goal & 2 assists, Scheifele goal & assist. Morrissey & Barron the other goals. Jets are now 13-9-4 & next at #Isles Friday night. Jets are 9-1-1 in their last 11...Barron is on a heater...",
